0,"stats":[73,79,65,41,62,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,79,65,41,62,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,79,65,41,62,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10347","city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,79,65,41,62,61],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国大将黄忠之子，英年早逝。相传黄叙为黄忠唯一子嗣，早年跟随黄忠征战沙场。一日黄忠偶得赤血刀，黄叙十分喜爱想尝试驾驭，但反被刀内的邪气反噬，最终在沙场上出了意外而战死，此后黄忠从未让他人碰过赤血刀。","tc":"蜀國大將黃忠之子，英年早逝。相傳黃敘為黃忠唯一子嗣，早年跟隨黃忠征戰沙場。一日黃忠偶得赤血刀，黃敘十分喜愛想嘗試駕馭，但反被刀內的邪氣反噬，最終在沙場上出了意外而戰死，此后黃忠從未讓他人碰過赤血刀。","en":"Son of the great Shu general Huang Zhong, who died young. It is said Huang Xu was Huang Zhong's only heir, following his father into battle from an early age. One day Huang Zhong obtained the Crimson Blood Saber. Huang Xu took a great liking to it and tried to wield it, but was instead consumed by the evil aura within the saber and ultimately died in battle. Thereafter, Huang Zhong never let anyone touch the Crimson Blood Saber again.","jp":"蜀の大将・黄忠の子で、早世した。黄叙は黄忠の唯一の子息と伝えられ、若くして父に従い戦場を転戦した。ある日、黄忠が偶然赤血刀を手に入れた際、黄叙はこれを大いに気に入って使いこなそうと試みたが、かえって刀に宿る邪気に呑まれ、最後は戦場で不慮の事故に見舞われて戦死した。それ以後、黄忠は決して他人に赤血刀を触れさせなかったという。","kr":"촉나라 대장 황충의 아들로, 젊은 나이에 요절했습니다. 전해지는 바에 따르면 황서는 황충의 유일한 후사로, 일찍이 황충을 따라 전장을 누볐습니다. 어느 날 황충이 우연히 적혈도를 얻자 황서가 이를 몹시 마음에 들어 하여 다루어 보고자 했으나, 도리어 도에 깃든 사기에 잠식당해 결국 전장에서 변을 당하여 전사하고 말았습니다. 이 일 이후로 황충은 다른 누구에게도 적혈도에 손을 대지 못하게 했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1012502","remark":"","surname":"黄","surnameTc":"黃","surnameEn":"Huang","surnameJp":"黄","surnameKr":"황","surnameOther":"","name":"叙","nameTc":"敘","nameEn":"Xu","nameJp":"叙","nameKr":"서","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"黄叙","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"200","city":"CS1047","gender":"0","rule":"73","force":"79","wise":"65","politics":"41","charm":"62","will":"61","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"30/30/62/30/78/20/50/30","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000805","battleSoul":"1009005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5300","battleSoulPoint":"6200","debateSoulPoint":"4200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000205","professions":"0/2/3/3/0/0/2/0/1/0/0/1/2/0/4/0/2/1/0/2/0/4/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"55","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"174","show":"200","death":"208","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1009205","helmet":"WP1020805","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;3/1;9/1;10/1;18/1;38/1;30/0","father":"WJ10016/0","mo